* text=auto eol=lf

*.sdf   text
*.world text
*.yaml  text
*.yml   text
*.py    text
*.sh    text

*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary

# --- Git LFS (optional) -----------------------------------------------------
# 只有在确实需要把大文件纳入版本管理时才启用，且必须先装 git-lfs：
#   sudo apt install git-lfs && git lfs install
# 否则 `git add` 会因为缺少 filter 而报错。默认策略是：权重/日志/数据一律
# 走 Release 附件，不进仓库（见 .gitignore）。
#
# *.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.pt   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.bag  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.ulg  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
